---
title: RAG Assistant - Class Diagram
---
classDiagram
direction TB
%% Simplified view of backend/app. Method names match the code.
%% Several backend components are Python modules of functions rather than classes;
%% they are shown as <<module>> boxes with a readable name and their source file.
%% Arrow --> means "uses / calls".
%% Colours: green = API routes, blue = processing services, purple = LLM,
%%          yellow = data stores (PostgreSQL and Qdrant).

class UploadRouter {
    <<API>>
    POST /api/upload
    +upload_document(file, user)
}

class QueryRouter {
    <<API>>
    POST /api/query
    +query_documents(question, user)
}

class IngestionService {
    <<module>>
    services/ingestion.py
    +ingest_document(file, document_id, user_id)
    steps: parse, chunk, embed, store
}

class Embeddings {
    <<module>>
    core/embeddings.py
    model : bge-small-en-v1.5
    +embed_documents(texts)
    +embed_query(question)
}

class QdrantVectorStore {
    <<Vector DB>>
    collection_name : document_chunks
    +upsert_chunks(chunks, embeddings)
    +search(query_embedding, limit)
    +delete_document(document_id)
}

class HybridRetrieval {
    <<module>>
    services/hybrid_retrieval.py
    +hybrid_search(query, dense_results, corpus)
    BM25 + vector results fused with RRF
}

class Reranker {
    <<module>>
    services/reranking.py
    model : cross-encoder
    +rerank_results(query, results, limit)
}

class LLMClient {
    <<LLM>>
    core/llm/openai_client.py
    model : gpt-5-mini
    +generate_answer(query, context, history)
}

class DocumentStore {
    <<PostgreSQL>>
    table : documents
    +create_document(...)
    +list_documents(user_id)
    +delete_document(document_id, user_id)
}

class ConversationStore {
    <<PostgreSQL>>
    tables : conversations, messages
    +add_message(conversation_id, role, content)
    +get_recent_messages(conversation_id)
}

UploadRouter --> IngestionService : processes file
UploadRouter --> DocumentStore : saves metadata
IngestionService --> Embeddings : embeds chunks
IngestionService --> QdrantVectorStore : stores vectors

QueryRouter --> Embeddings : embeds question
QueryRouter --> QdrantVectorStore : vector search
QueryRouter --> HybridRetrieval : combines results
QueryRouter --> Reranker : reorders chunks
QueryRouter --> LLMClient : generates answer
QueryRouter --> ConversationStore : reads / saves history

